sm\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between h-20 items-center\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex items-center\"><a class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[#064e3b] flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8 filter drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.35)] hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9 9H15L17 2H7L9 9Z\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\"></path><path d=\"M7 2L9 9H2L7 2Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"></path><path d=\"M17 2L15 9H22L17 2Z\" fill=\"#059669\"></path><path d=\"M9 9H15L12 22L9 9Z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path><path d=\"M2 9H9L12 22L2 9Z\" fill=\"#065f46\"></path><path d=\"M15 9H22L12 22L15 9Z\" fill=\"#047857\"></path></svg>Jade Fortune</a></div><div class=\"nav-mobile-only items-center\"><button class=\"text-[#064e3b] hover:text-[#059669] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-inset focus:ring-[#059669] rounded-md p-2\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Open main menu</span><svg class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"nav-desktop-only nav-desktop-space-x items-center w-full justify-end hidden\"><a class=\"text-[#064e3b] font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80 whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a style=\"color:#064e3b\" class=\"font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80 whitespace-nowrap\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How It Works</a><div class=\"relative\"><button style=\"color:#064e3b\" class=\"flex items-center font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80 gap-1 whitespace-nowrap\">More<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 transition-transform \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative\"><button style=\"color:#064e3b\" class=\"flex items-center font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80 gap-1 whitespace-nowrap\">Issuer<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 transition-transform \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center font-medium transition-colors hover:opacity-80 gap-1 whitespace-nowrap\">Investors<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 transition-transform \" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"flex-grow relative z-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col min-h-screen bg-[#fdfbf7] pb-24\"><section class=\"pt-32 pb-16 px-4 text-center relative overflow-hidden\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#064e3b] tracking-tight mb-6\">Simple, Transparent Pricing</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-[#064e3b]/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">We only succeed when you succeed. No hidden fees, no complicated tiers.</p></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 w-full mt-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-bl-full -mr-16 -mt-16 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2\">For Creators</h2><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 mb-8\">Launch your project with zero upfront costs.</p><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#059669]/10 text-[#059669] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl shrink-0\">5%</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b]\">Platform Fee</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70\">Applied only to successfully funded projects.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0\">~3%</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b]\">Payment Processing</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70\">Standard credit card processing fees ($0.30 per transaction).</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold shrink-0\">Varies</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b]\">Audit Fee (Optional)</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70\">Paid to independent issuers for the verification badge.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-gray-100 pt-8 md:pt-0 md:pl-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2\">For Backers</h2><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 mb-8\">Invest without worrying about overhead.</p><div class=\"bg-[#ecfdf5] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#34d399]/30 mb-8\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#059669] mb-2\">0%</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-1\">Platform Fee</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70\">Backers never pay a fee to pledge on Jade Fortune.</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669]\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Free account creation</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669]\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Access to all audited projects</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669]\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>No hidden transaction fees</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-[95%] xl:max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 w-full mt-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-4\">Creator Launch Plans</h2><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#059669] mx-auto rounded-full\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 xl:gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white p-6 xl:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#f2eadb] shadow-sm flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2\">Bronze</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 text-sm mb-6\">Perfect for small projects and initial raises.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#064e3b] mb-6\">5%<!-- --> <span class=\"text-lg font-normal text-[#064e3b]/50\">fee</span></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Basic project listing</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Standard support</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-gray-400 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\"></path></svg>Independent Audit Badge</li></ul><a class=\"block w-full py-3 px-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#059669] text-[#059669] font-bold text-center rounded-full hover:bg-[#ecfdf5] transition-colors\" href=\"/register\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6 xl:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#f2eadb] shadow-sm flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2\">Silver</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 text-sm mb-6\">For growing creators building an audience.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#064e3b] mb-6\">4.5%<!-- --> <span class=\"text-lg font-normal text-[#064e3b]/50\">fee</span></div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Enhanced project listing</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Priority support</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Community features</li></ul><a class=\"block w-full py-3 px-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#059669] text-[#059669] font-bold text-center rounded-full hover:bg-[#ecfdf5] transition-colors\" href=\"/register\">Get Started</a></div><div class=\"bg-[#064e3b] p-6 xl:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-[#064e3b] shadow-xl shadow-[#064e3b]/20 flex flex-col transform md:-translate-y-4 relative\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -mt-4 bg-[#34d399] text-[#064e3b] text-xs font-bo