mb-6\">For large-scale equity raises and syndicates.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#064e3b] mb-6\">Custom</div><ul class=\"space-y-4 mb-8 flex-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Dedicated Account Manager</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Advanced Smart Contract</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#064e3b]/80 text-sm\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-[#059669] shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg>Legal Structuring Assistance</li></ul><a class=\"block w-full py-3 px-4 bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 text-gray-600 font-bold text-center rounded-full hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Sales</a></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-24 text-center px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-6\">Ready to launch your vision?</h2><a class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-900 text-white rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:brightness-110 shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-600/20 transition-all\" href=\"/how-it-works\">Start a Project</a></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-diamond-grid-green text-[#fdfbf7]/80 py-12 mt-auto border-t border-[#10b981]/20 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#10b981] to-[#064e3b]\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div sty